<Layout title="CRA Lead Automation - Mas Muhammad" description="An enterprise customs declaration reconciliation system for import/export compliance and duty optimization. Processes PIB/PEB declarations, reconciles against SAP ERP data (MB51, FBL1N, FBL3N), validates HS codes, freight costs, and certificates of origin — with automated batch scheduling and Power BI reporting.">
