    <h1 class="cs-hero-title">
      CRA Lead Automation<br>
      <span>Customs Reconciliation Application</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="cs-hero-desc">
      An enterprise customs declaration reconciliation system for import/export compliance and duty optimization. Processes PIB/PEB declarations, reconciles against SAP ERP data (MB51, FBL1N, FBL3N), validates HS codes, freight costs, and certificates of origin — with automated batch scheduling and Power BI reporting.
    </p>
